<view class="page safe-bottom">
  <view class="eyebrow">TOOLS</view>
  <view class="title-xl">工具不是越多越好。</view>
  <view class="body intro">首版只保留能讲完整闭环的四件事：测评、录入、雷达、私教。</view>

  <view class="section tool-list">
    <view class="tool-card panel" wx:for="{{tools}}" wx:key="key">
      <view class="between">
        <view>
          <view class="tool-name">{{item.name}}</view>
          <view class="muted tool-desc">{{item.desc}}</view>
        </view>
        <view class="tool-key">{{index + 1}}</view>
      </view>
      <button class="ghost-button tool-action" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="openTool">{{item.action}}</button>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="section panel-quiet">
    <view class="title-md">不上 OCR 的处理</view>
    <view class="body">当前版本可以选择图片留档，但不会承诺自动识别。真正参与诊断的是你录入的题号、错题、分数和作业清单。</view>
  </view>
</view>
